<title>USA: American Oilfield Divers names president.</title>
<headline>American Oilfield Divers names president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Oilfield Divers Inc said it named Rod Stanley president and chief executive to replace George Yax, who will remain chairman.</p>
<p>Stanley, 52, will help the company diversify its operations through technology and acquisitions, the company said.</p>
<p>He joined the company in August as senior vice president of international operations, the company said.</p>
</text>
